title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/view:zoom
catalog: GUI command
target: view:zoom
summary: Zoom a panel in, out or back to 100 % (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``-`` → ``view:zoom self out``
* ``0`` → ``view:zoom self reset``
* ``plus`` → ``view:zoom self in``
